NOTICE:  rejected: ALTER TABLE r_led ADD COLUMN c_pair_arr r_pair[] -> KL002 the statement leaves the ledger broken (column: public.r_led: column "c_pair_arr" is an array of a user-defined type, which is not supported yet)
NOTICE:  rejected: ALTER TABLE r_led ADD COLUMN c_color_arr r_color[] -> KL002 the statement leaves the ledger broken (column: public.r_led: column "c_color_arr" is an array of a user-defined type, which is not supported yet)
NOTICE:  rejected: ALTER TABLE r_led ADD COLUMN c_acl aclitem -> KL002 the statement leaves the ledger broken (column: public.r_led: column "c_acl" has type aclitem without a binary send function)
NOTICE:  rejected: ALTER TABLE r_led ADD COLUMN c_acl_arr aclitem[] -> KL002 the statement leaves the ledger broken (column: public.r_led: column "c_acl_arr" is an array whose element type is not supported (has type aclitem without a binary send function))
